{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642040","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1064204001:0":{"text":"내가... 쓰러뜨렸어...","source_cn":"我……打败它了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46B2B7B64B096F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064204002:1":{"text":"마이카, 아로라! 봤어? 마물이 사라졌어. 우리...","source_cn":"迈克尔，奥萝菈！你们看到没？魔物消失了！我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F65A674D7373DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1064204003:0":{"text":"아인은 흥분한 채 뒤를 돌아보았지만, 뒤에는 아무도 없었다","source_cn":"埃因兴奋地回头望去，却发现身后空无一人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6314D5ADBFB96342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064204004:0":{"text":"...마이카? 아로라?","source_cn":"……迈克尔？奥萝菈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9304E91B9976D4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064204005:1":{"text":"두 사람 다... 어디 있어?!","source_cn":"你们……你们在哪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB581C156420FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064204006:1":{"text":"마치 폭우처럼 쏟아져 내린 불안감은 방금 전까지 타오르던 흥분을 순식간에 꺼뜨렸고, 이내 희미한 검은 연기만을 남겼다.","source_cn":"不安如同暴雨倾盆而下，刹那间浇灭了方才的兴奋，只余下缥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00898050CF3F8092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064204007:1":{"text":"칠흑 같은 밤 속에는 끝없는 어둠 속을 미친 듯이 달리며, 두 사람을 찾는 아인의 절망적인 외침만 울려 퍼졌다.","source_cn":"埃因一边在无涯的黑暗中狂奔，一边疯狂寻找着他们，漆黑之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20906271FD474B85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064204008:1":{"text":"그런 아인의 눈앞에 작은 빛 무리 하나가 피어났고, 이내 무수한 빛들이 그 주위로 모여들기 시작했다. 자애로움으로 가득 찬 그 빛은 격하게 요동치던 아인의 심장을 서서히 달래주었다.","source_cn":"直到一星光点出现在他面前，越来越多光向那里汇聚，那是充...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C06B1AA66F3ED8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064204009:1":{"text":"이윽고 눈부신 빛무리를 헤치며 누군가의 실루엣이 다가왔다. 아인은 가늘게 뜬 눈으로 간신히 상대의 얼굴을 마주했다. ...설마, 듀라 여신?!","source_cn":"一个身影从光中向他走来，埃因眯起眼睛想要看清对方的长相...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FFDEBDCD97240C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064204010:1":{"text":"듀라 여신은 아니었다. 그건...","source_cn":"不对……那是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C8A98FC38F6DFD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064204011:0":{"text":"무서워하지 말아요... 아인.","source_cn":"别害怕……埃因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E13FEC4E0D3C578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064204012:0":{"text":"...아로라?","source_cn":"……奥萝菈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98CA13837272D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064204013:0":{"text":"긴장 풀어요. 저예요, 아로라.","source_cn":"别紧张。是我，奥萝菈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x974997F0F7CCCBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064204014:0":{"text":"너... 너 도대체 뭐야?","source_cn":"你……你到底是什么人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA672232077000CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064204015:0":{"text":"걱정하지 말아요... 전 당신을 해치지 않아요.","source_cn":"无需担忧……我不会伤害你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DAE368DDC7B1DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064204016:1":{"text":"이미 짐작했겠지만, 저는 꿈속 세계의 길잡이예요. 끔찍한 악몽에서 당신을 구하기 위해 찾아왔죠.","source_cn":"也许你已经猜到，我是梦境的引路人。我来到这里，是为了引...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CEC227BD368493D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064204017:1":{"text":"악몽...? 무슨 말이야?","source_cn":"噩梦……？什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D7DAB6456C9A8F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064204018:1":{"text":"당신은 오랫동안 악몽에 갇혀 있었어요...","source_cn":"长久以来，你都被困在一场噩梦之中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AFC8E077F68D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064204019:1":{"text":"전쟁의 불길이 하늘을 뒤덮고, 마이카가 죽기 직전의 장면이 몇 번이고 반복되는 악몽이었죠...","source_cn":"噩梦中，战火连天……迈克尔临死前的场景一次又一次重复上演……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDD3FBE53DE707E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064204020:1":{"text":"그리고 당신은 매번 마이카를 부축해 일으키고, 전쟁터에서 함께 빠져나가 마이카의 목숨을 구하려고 했죠...","source_cn":"而你，一遍遍地扶起他，想要将他带离战场，拯救他的生命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x563D6471A38284EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064204021:1":{"text":"단 한 번도 마이카를 버리지 않았어요.","source_cn":"没有任何一次，你真的狠下心，抛弃他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3769D0C04CE9F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064204022:1":{"text":"하지만... 나는 마이카를 구하지 못했어...","source_cn":"但是……但是我没有真的救下他。对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1894661AC0B50947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064204023:1":{"text":"심지어 그 일 때문에 내 다리마저 다쳐서... 더는 움직일 수 없게 되었는데...","source_cn":"甚至……甚至我的两条腿也因此受伤，再也行动不了了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9B9DCF7DBCDB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064204024:1":{"text":"그래서 당신은 생각하게 된 거예요. \"만약, 그때 마이카를 구하지 않았더라면 어떻게 되었을까?\" 하고 말이에요.","source_cn":"所以，你不断地想：假如……当时没有救他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1384201CEE563584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064204025:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064204026:1":{"text":"하지만 당신은 선량한 사람이에요. 그 마음 깊은 곳에서는 빛이 언제나 어둠과 맞서고 있었죠...","source_cn":"可你是一个善良的人。在你内心深处，光辉始终抵抗着这份灰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D6373A3FEF3A4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064204027:1":{"text":"그리고 빛과 어둠이 충돌하는 사이에서 그림자가 태어났어요... 그게 바로 당신을 계속 괴롭히고 고통스럽게 만든 내면의 그림자랍니다.","source_cn":"光与暗的碰撞中，影子，诞生了……那便是一直折磨着你，令...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A8E19F48F108B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064204028:1":{"text":"하지만 보세요. 당신은 이겨냈고, 악몽은 사라졌어요.","source_cn":"但你看……你战胜它了。噩梦消散了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B41342A3EAAD20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064204029:1":{"text":"그래도 마이카를 구하지 못했잖아...","source_cn":"……可我还是没有救下迈克尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB0D3D36AEE25D58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064204030:1":{"text":"그건 당신의 잘못이 아니에요. 전쟁은 냉혹한 법이니까요...","source_cn":"那不是你的错。战争，从来都是无情的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC22BD475C0A0FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064204031:1":{"text":"그리고 케이트, 라운, 사미르... 다른 사람들을 구했잖아요?","source_cn":"而且，你也成功救下了很多人，不是吗？凯特、劳恩、萨米尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4A252DA37ED9FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064204032:1":{"text":"편지를 읽어 보세요. 꿈속에서도 모두가 여전히 당신을 걱정하고 있는 마음이 아주 또렷하게 느껴져요... ","source_cn":"去看看他们寄来的信吧。我能感受到……即使在梦境之中，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C7BCEA37D9AF7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064204033:1":{"text":"아니... 넌 몰라. 난 살아남아서는 안 됐어!","source_cn":"不……你不懂……我不该活下来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43B9FDE37F837FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064204034:1":{"text":"이런 쓸모없는 몸을 끌고 사는 건 짐이 될 뿐이야! 우리 엄마는 나이도 많은데 하루 종일 나를 돌봐야 한다고!","source_cn":"拖着这副无用的身躯，我是个累赘！我妈一把年纪还要成天照顾我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB84269EF02D323CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064204035:1":{"text":"오... 아로라, 왜 이 녀석한테 이렇게까지 집착하는 거야? 난 슬슬 이 녀석을 네 아름다운 꿈속 세계에서 내보내고 싶은데.","source_cn":"噢……奥萝菈，他怎么还在纠结这件事？我有点想把他扔出你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738FB4B57CAFD11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064204036:1":{"text":"...또 그 목소리야!\n<shk>누구야?! 대체 누가 말하고 있는 거야?!</shk>","source_cn":"——又是那声音！\\n<shk>谁？！到底是谁在说话？！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71ADE3186D04FD8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064204037:1":{"text":"신경 쓰지 마세요. 새니는 제 동료이자 친구랍니다.","source_cn":"请别介意。桑尼是我的朋友，我的伙伴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C937C5F8C849B7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064204038:1":{"text":"하지만... 새니의 말이 맞아요. 슬슬 이곳에서 나갈 시간이 되었네요.","source_cn":"不过，他说的也没错……你该离开这里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8754B9AAD139E07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064204039:1":{"text":"미래를 걱정할 필요는 없어요, 당신은 용감하고 선량한 사람이니까, 언젠가 소원이 반드시 이루어질 거예요...","source_cn":"不必为未来担忧。你是一个勇敢而善良的人，终有一日，你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7696F84A478C47FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064204040:1":{"text":"그리고 그날은 머지않았어요.","source_cn":"而那一日，已经不远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x221044CC488EBC8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064204041:1":{"text":"내... 소원? 무슨 소원?","source_cn":"我的……心愿？什么心愿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2EA785CB6F2E243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064204042:1":{"text":"마음 깊숙이 숨겨져 있는... 가장 간절한 바람이요. 곧 알게 될 거예요.","source_cn":"潜藏于内心的……最深切的愿望。你很快就会得到答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C1B8D992BF976B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064204043:1":{"text":"그리고 지금은...","source_cn":"至于现在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0DF75216AF2C8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064204044:1":{"text":"가장 아름다운 아침을 맞이하러 가세요.","source_cn":"去吧……迎接一个美好的清晨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7F07C248A6395DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064204045:1":{"text":"언제나 좋은 꿈 꾸길 빌게요...","source_cn":"祝愿你，永远好梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C08E7C78DB6C706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:52:1064204046:1":{"text":"그녀의 말이 끝나기가 무섭게, 아인의 눈앞은 순식간에 짙은 어둠 속으로 가라앉았다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BEBB6027AEAE2ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:53:1064204047:1":{"text":"기억도 마치 검은 안개가 덮인 듯, 점점 흐릿해졌다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x349BCC32C46A71EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:54:1064204048:1":{"text":"시간이 얼마나 흘렀을까. 귓가를 맴도는 맑은 새소리에, 아인은 부스스 눈을 떴다","source_cn":"不知多久之后，清晨的鸟鸣唤醒了他","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E5BAE29CB1C556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064204049:0":{"text":"음... 아침이네.","source_cn":"唔……天亮了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCD87BEF5B67E3E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064204050:1":{"text":"이상한 꿈을 꾼 것 같은데... 뭐였더라?","source_cn":"我好像做了一个奇怪的梦……梦到了什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6D34FEBBCB2D64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064204051:0":{"text":"하... 계속 누워만 있어서 그런가, 머리도 둔해지고 기억력도 나빠진 건가?","source_cn":"哈……是因为一直躺着，连脑子也变笨了、记忆力也变差了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE27260640434477A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064204052:0":{"text":"에휴, 평생 이 다리를 가지고...","source_cn":"要是一辈子，我这双腿都——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DD3D483701784B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064204053:0":{"text":"...잠깐, 내 다리...","source_cn":"……等等，我的腿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B28A9091116FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064204054:1":{"text":"다리를... 조금 움직일 수 있을 것 같은데?!","source_cn":"好像……好像可以挪动一点了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C516A048737D01A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064204055:1":{"text":"엄마! 엄마...! 얼른 와봐. 다리에 감각이 돌아온 것 같아!","source_cn":"妈！妈——！快来啊！我的腿好像有知觉了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC570094CB50B670B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃因":{"text":"아인","source":"埃因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"아로라","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雄厚的声音":{"text":"중후한 목소리","source":"雄厚的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":56,"localized_text_count":55,"speaker_count":5}}